Changelog: 22-11-2026 18:33:23

Fixed. The app's copy of core's exit_keys.py takes out the window class that pygame sets when it starts, as
core/bazzite_console_core/exit_keys.py does. A program the app starts no longer inherits it.
tools/tests/test_instance_copies.py checks that the copy matches core.

Changelog: 22-11-2026 18:07:29

Fixed. upscaler/help.py.orig, an old copy of the Help page that nothing used, is gone.

Changelog: 22-11-2026 18:06:12

Fixed. The Help page is short now, as the owner decided. It says what the app does, links to the app's chapter in the
wiki and shows where its files are. What only the Help page said moved into the wiki chapter, with a new table of the
helixsr.ini keys and a new Good to know section. Two facts of the old Help page were wrong and are corrected in the
chapter. The Help page said that Vulkan games are not supported. From HelixSR 3 on, HelixSR Scaler takes DirectX 11
and Vulkan games. The Help page gave the release zip as 2 MB. A HelixSR 3 release is about 280 MB, as the chapter
already said. The chapter's line about the Help page now says what the page shows. Nothing the app does has changed.

